234.56</option></select></label>${table(['Normalized value','Finding'],rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r.value===null?'—':esc(r.value)}</td><td>${esc(r.finding)}</td></tr>`).join(''))}</div></div><p class=\"calculation\">No silent locale guessing. Invalid and empty values stay unresolved; zero stays zero. Repeated numeric values are flagged for review, never automatically deleted as duplicate records.</p>`;$('#cleanup-text').onchange=e=>{cleanupText=e.target.value;cleanup()};$('#cleanup-locale').onchange=e=>{cleanupLocale=e.target.value;cleanup()};$('#cleanup-export').onclick=()=>csvDownload('cleanup-demo.csv',[['Demonstration Data'],['Raw','Normalized','Finding'],...rows.map(r=>[r.raw,r.value,r.finding])]);}\n\nconst commerceProducts=[\n  {id:'sera-notebook',name:'Field Notes Notebook',category:'Desk',price:68000,tone:'sand',tag:'A5 / 160 pages',variants:[['Grid',7],['Plain',5],['Dotted',3]]},\n  {id:'sera-tray',name:'Modular Desk Tray',category:'Desk',price:129000,tone:'clay',tag:'Powder-coated steel',variants:[['Graphite',4],['Bone',6]]},\n  {id:'sera-bottle',name:'Everyday Bottle',category:'Carry',price:158000,tone:'steel',tag:'600 ml / insulated',variants:[['Steel',5],['Forest',2],['Signal',1]]},\n  {id:'sera-tote',name:'Transit Canvas Tote',category:'Carry',price:184000,tone:'forest',tag:'Reinforced canvas',variants:[['Natural',6],['Charcoal',4]]},\n  {id:'sera-pouch',name:'Cable Pouch',category:'Utility',price:97000,tone:'ink',tag:'Five internal loops',variants:[['Small',8],['Large',3]]},\n  {id:'sera-cap',name:'Linen Work Cap',category:'Wear',price:142000,tone:'oat',tag:'Adjustable fit',variants:[['Oat',5],['Graphite',4]]}\n];\nconst commerceShipping={regular:{label:'Regular delivery',note:'2–3 working days',price:18000},express:{label:'Express delivery',note:'Next working day',price:32000},pickup:{label:'Studio pickup',note:'Balikpapan / scheduled',price:0}};\nconst commerceVouchers={WELCOME10:{minimum:150000,label:'10% off, maximum Rp35,000',discount:subtotal=>Math.min(35000,Math.round(subtotal*.1))},SHIP20:{minimum:100000,label:'Shipping discount, maximum Rp20,000',shipping:shipping=>Math.min(20000,shipping)}};\n\nfunction commerceMoney(value){return new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID',{style:'currency',currency:'IDR',maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(value);}\nfunction commerceKey(id,variant){return `${id}::${variant}`;}\n\nfunction commerceDemo(){\n  let view={query:'',category:'All',sort:'recommended',shipping:'regular',voucher:'',voucherMessage:''};\n  let cart={};\n  try{cart=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('living-commerce-cart')||'{}')||{};}catch{}\n  const root=$('#commerce-demo');\n  root.innerHTML=`<div class=\"commerce-demo\">\n    <div class=\"commerce-notice\"><span>INTERACTIVE DEMO / FICTIONAL STORE</span><span>Nothing is purchased, sent, or stored on a server.</span></div>\n    <header class=\"commerce-store-head\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">SERA / USEFUL THINGS</span><h3>Quiet objects.<br><i>Clear choices.</i></h3></div><button id=\"commerce-cart-jump\" aria-label=\"Open cart\">Cart <b id=\"commerce-cart-count\">0</b></button></header>\n    <div class=\"commerce-layout\">\n      <section class=\"commerce-catalog\" aria-label=\"Product catalogue\">\n        <div class=\"commerce-toolbar\"><label><span>Search the collection</span><input id=\"commerce-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Notebook, bottle, tote…\"></label><label><span>Sort</span><select id=\"commerce-sort\"><option value=\"recommended\">Recommended</option><option value=\"price-low\">Price: low to high</option><option value=\"price-high\">Price: high to low</option><option value=\"name\">Name</option></select></label></div>\n        <div class=\"commerce-categories\" id=\"commerce-categories\"></div>\n        <p class=\"commerce-result-count\" id=\"commerce-result-count\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        <div class=\"commerce-grid\" id=\"commerce-grid\"></div>\n      </section>\n      <aside class=\"commerce-cart\" id=\"commerce-cart\" aria-label=\"Shopping cart\"><div id=\"commerce-cart-content\"></div></aside>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"commerce-checkout\" id=\"commerce-checkout\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">CHECKOUT / REVIEW FIRST</span><h3>A short finish.<br><i>No hidden total.</i></h3><p>Choose delivery, apply a demonstration voucher, then review the information that a production Apps Script would validate again on the server.</p></div><form id=\"commerce-checkout-form\"><label>Recipient name<input name=\"recipient\" required maxlength=\"60\" placeholder=\"For example: Maya\"></label><label>Contact number<input name=\"phone\" required inputmode=\"tel\" pattern=\"[0-9 +()-]{8,20}\" maxlength=\"20\" placeholder=\"For example: 0812 0000 0000\"></label><label class=\"wide\">Delivery address<textarea name=\"address\" required minlength=\"12\" maxlength=\"240\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Use a fictional address for this demonstration.\"></textarea></label><label>City<select name=\"city\"><option>Balikpapan</option><option>Samarinda</option><option>Bontang</option></select></label><label>Payment plan<select name=\"payment\"><option>Bank transfer</option><option>E-wallet</option><option>Cash on pickup</option></select></label><label class=\"wide consent\"><input name=\"demo\" type=\"checkbox\" required> I understand this is a local demonstration and no order will be submitted.</label><button class=\"solid-button wide\" type=\"submit\">Review demonstration order ↗</button></form><div class=\"commerce-order\" id=\"commerce-order\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\"></div></section>\n    <section class=\"commerce-blueprint\"><div class=\"commerce-blueprint-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PRODUCTION BLUEPRINT / GOOGLE SHEETS + APPS SCRIPT</span><h3>Simple storage.<br><i>Strict decisions.</i></h3><p>The spreadsheet stays understandable, while Apps Script owns validation, stock locking, order numbers, and every sensitive write.</p></div><div class=\"commerce-sheet-map\">${[['Products','Title, price, category, status'],['Variants','SKU, option, stock, weight'],['Vouchers','Rule, minimum, cap, active dates'],['Shipping','Zone, service, rate, estimate'],['Orders','Customer, totals, status, timestamps'],['Order Items','Order ID, SKU, quantity, unit price']].map((item,i)=>`<article><b>0${i+1}</b><span>${item[0]}</span><small>${item[1]}</small></article>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"commerce-flow\"><span>Browser</span><b>→</b><span>Apps Script</span><b>→</b><span>Reprice & lock stock</span><b>→</b><span>Sheets + Drive</span></div><p class=\"disclosure\">A production checkout must never trust totals sent by the browser. Apps Script would reload the SKU, price, voucher, shipping rule, and available stock before writing the order inside a lock.</p></section>\n  </div>`;\n\n  function persist(){try{localStorage.setItem('living-commerce-cart',JSON.stringify(cart));}catch{}}\n  function product(id){return commerceProducts.find(item=>item.id===id);}\n  function stockFor(item,variant){return item?.variants.find(option=>option[0]===variant)?.[1]||0;}\n  function cartLines(){return Object.entries(cart).map(([key,quantity])=>{const [id,variant]=key.split('::'),item=product(id);return item?{key,item,variant,quantity:Number(quantity)||0}:null;}).filter(line=>line&&line.quantity>0);}\n  function subtotal(){return cartLines().reduce((sum,line)=>sum+line.item.price*line.quantity,0);}\n  function totals(){const sub=subtotal(),shipping=commerceShipping[view.shipping].price,voucher=commerceVouchers[view.voucher],eligible=voucher&&sub>=voucher.minimum,productDiscount=eligible&&voucher.discount?voucher.discount(sub):0,shippingDiscount=eligible&&voucher.shipping?voucher.shipping(shipping):0;return {sub,shipping,productDiscount,shippingDiscount,total:Math.max(0,sub-productDiscount+shipping-shippingDiscount),eligible};}\n  function categories(){const names=['All',...new Set(commerceProducts.map(item=>item.category))];$('#commerce-categories').innerHTML=names.map(name=>`<button data-commerce-category=\"${esc(name)}\" aria-pressed=\"${view.category===name}\">${esc(name)}</button>`).join('');$$('[data-commerce-category]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{view.category=button.dataset.commerceCategory;categories();drawProducts();});}\n  function drawProducts(){let items=commerceProducts.filter(item=>(view.category==='All'||item.category===view.category)&&[item.name,item.category,item.tag].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(view.query.toLowerCase()));if(view.sort==='price-low')items.sort((a,b)=>a.price-b.price);if(view.sort==='price-high')items.sort((a,b)=>b.price-a.price);if(view.sort==='name')items.sort((a,b)=>a.name.localeCompare(b.name));$('#commerce-result-count').textContent=`${items.length} of ${commerceProducts.length} products`;\n    $('#commerce-grid').innerHTML=items.length?items.map(item=>`<article class=\"commerce-product\"><div class=\"commerce-product-art tone-${item.tone}\"><span>${esc(item.category)}</span><b>${esc(item.name.split(' ')[0])}</b><i>${esc(item.tag)}</i></div><div class=\"commerce-product-copy\"><small>${esc(item.category)} / ${esc(item.tag)}</small><h4>${esc(item.name)}</h4><strong>${commerceMoney(item.price)}</strong><label>Option<select data-commerce-variant=\"${item.id}\">${item.variants.map(option=>`<option value=\"${esc(option[0])}\" ${option[1]===0?'disabled':''}>${esc(option[0])} · ${option[1]} left</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button data-commerce-add=\"${item.id}\">Add to cart +</button></div></article>`).join(''):'<div class=\"commerce-empty\"><h4>Nothing matches that search.</h4><p>Try a category or a simpler word.</p></div>';\n    $$('[data-commerce-add]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const item=product(button.dataset.commerceAdd),select=$(`[data-commerce-variant=\"${item.id}\"]`),variant=select.value,key=commerceKey(item.id,variant),stock=stockFor(item,variant);if((cart[key]||0)>=stock){toast(`Only ${stock} available in this demonstration.`);return;}cart[key]=(cart[key]||0)+1;view.voucherMessage='';persist();drawCart();toast(`${item.name} added.`);});\n  }\n  function drawCart(){const lines=cartLines(),amounts=totals();$('#commerce-cart-count').textContent=lines.reduce((sum,line)=>sum+line.quantity,0);$('#commerce-cart-content').innerHTML=`<div class=\"commerce-cart-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR CART</span><button id=\"commerce-clear\" ${lines.length?'':'disabled'}>Clear</button></div>${lines.length?`<div class=\"commerce-cart-lines\">${lines.map(line=>`<article><div><b>${esc(line.item.name)}</b><small>${esc(line.variant)}</small><span>${commerceMoney(line.item.price)}</span></div><div class=\"commerce-quantity\"><button data-commerce-minus=\"${esc(line.key)}\" aria-label=\"Reduce ${esc(line.item.name)}\">−</button><span>${line.quantity}</span><button data-commerce-plus=\"${esc(line.key)}\" aria-label=\"Add another ${esc(line.item.name)}\">+</button></div></article>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class=\"commerce-cart-empty\"><p>Your cart is still quiet.</p><span>Add a product to start the calculation.</span></div>'}<form class=\"commerce-voucher\" id=\"commerce-voucher-form\"><label>Voucher code<input name=\"voucher\" value=\"${esc(view.voucher)}\" placeholder=\"WELCOME10 or SHIP20\"></label><button type=\"submit\">Apply</button></form><p class=\"commerce-voucher-note\" role=\"status\">${esc(view.voucherMessage||'Demo codes: WELCOME10 / SHIP20')}</p><label class=\"commerce-shipping\">Shipping<select id=\"commerce-shipping\">${Object.entries(commerceShipping).map(([key,method])=>`<option value=\"${key}\" ${key===view.shipping?'selected':''}>${method.label} · ${commerceMoney(method.price)}</option>`).join('')}</select><small>${esc(commerceShipping[view.shipping].note)}</small></label><dl class=\"commerce-totals\"><div><dt>Subtotal</dt><dd>${commerceMoney(amounts.sub)}</dd></div>${amounts.productDiscount?`<div><dt>Product discount</dt><dd>−${commerceMoney(amounts.productDiscount)}</dd></div>`:''}<div><dt>Shipping</dt><dd>${commerceMoney(amounts.shipping)}</dd></div>${amounts.shippingDiscount?`<div><dt>Shipping discount</dt><dd>−${commerceMoney(amounts.shippingDiscount)}</dd></div>`:''}<div class=\"commerce-grand-total\"><dt>Total</dt><dd>${commerceMoney(amounts.total)}</dd></div></dl><button class=\"solid-button commerce-checkout-jump\" id=\"commerce-checkout-jump\" ${lines.length?'':'disabled'}>Continue to checkout ↓</button>`;\n    $$('[data-commerce-minus]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{cart[button.dataset.commerceMinus]-=1;if(cart[button.dataset.commerceMinus]<=0)delete cart[button.dataset.commerceMinus];view.voucherMessage='';persist();drawCart();});\n    $$('[data-commerce-plus]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const [id,variant]=button.dataset.commercePlus.split('::'),item=product(id),stock=stockFor(item,variant);if(cart[button.dataset.commercePlus]>=stock){toast(`Only ${stock} available in this demonstration.`);return;}cart[button.dataset.commercePlus]+=1;view.voucherMessage='';persist();drawCart();});\n    $('#commerce-clear').onclick=()=>{cart={};view.voucher='';view.voucherMessage='Cart cleared.';persist();drawCart();};\n    $('#commerce-voucher-form').onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();const code=String(new FormData(event.currentTarget).get('voucher')||'').trim().toUpperCase(),voucher=commerceVouchers[code],sub=subtotal();if(!voucher){view.voucher='';view.voucherMessage=code?'That demonstration code is not available.':'Enter a voucher code.';}else if(sub<voucher.minimum){view.voucher=code;view.voucherMessage=`Add ${commerceMoney(voucher.minimum-sub)} more to use ${code}.`;}else{view.voucher=code;view.voucherMessage=`${code} applied: ${voucher.label}.`;}drawCart();};\n    $('#commerce-shipping').onchange=event=>{view.shipping=event.target.value;view.voucherMessage='';drawCart();};\n    $('#commerce-checkout-jump').onclick=()=>$('#commerce-checkout').scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced?'auto':'smooth'});\n  }\n  categories();drawProducts();drawCart();\n  $('#commerce-search').oninput=event=>{view.query=event.target.value;drawProducts();};\n  $('#commerce-sort').onchange=event=>{view.sort=event.target.value;drawProducts();};\n  $('#commerce-cart-jump').onclick=()=>$('#commerce-cart').scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced?'auto':'smooth',block:'start'});\n  $('#commerce-checkout-form').onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget,lines=cartLines();if(!lines.length){toast('Add at least one product before reviewing checkout.');return;}if(!form.reportValidity())return;const formData=new FormData(form),amounts=totals(),order=$('#commerce-order'),orderNumber=`DEMO-${String(Date.now()).slice(-6)}`;order.hidden=false;order.innerHTML=`<span class=\"eyebrow\">ORDER REVIEW / NOT SUBMITTED</span><div class=\"commerce-order-head\"><h3>${orderNumber}</h3><strong>${commerceMoney(amounts.total)}</strong></div><p>${esc(formData.get('recipient'))} · ${esc(formData.get('city'))} · ${esc(commerceShipping[view.shipping].label)}</p><div class=\"commerce-order-lines\">${lines.map(line=>`<span>${line.quantity} × ${esc(line.item.name)} / ${esc(line.variant)} <b>${commerceMoney(line.item.price*line.quantity)}</b></span>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"disclosure\">This summary only exists in your browser. A production system would now reprice every SKU, verify the voucher and shipping rule, lock stock, create the order, and only then return a confirmed order number.</p><button id=\"commerce-start-over\">Clear demonstration</button>`;$('#commerce-start-over').onclick=()=>{cart={};view.voucher='';view.voucherMessage='';persist();form.reset();order.hidden=true;drawCart();$('#commerce-grid').scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced?'auto':'smooth'});};order.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced?'auto':'smooth',block:'nearest'});};\n}\n\n// Decision tools use fictional records and calculate entirely in the browser.\nconst procurementVendors=[\n  {name:'Borneo Supply',price:184500000,lead:18,warranty:24,compliance:96,tax:true},\n  {name:'Nusantara Teknik',price:176800000,lead:28,warranty:18,compliance:91,tax:true},\n  {name:'Karya Prima',price:191200000,lead:14,warranty:36,compliance:98,tax:true},\n  {name:'Samarinda Industrial',price:169900000,lead:35,warranty:12,compliance:82,tax:false}\n];\nlet procurementWeights={price:40,lead:20,warranty:15,compliance:25};\n\nfunction appendOperationsLab(){\n  const tabs=$('#lab .lab-tabs');\n  if(!tabs||tabs.querySelector('[data-lab=\"6\"]'))return;\n  const button=document.createElement('button');\n  button.dataset.lab='6';\n  button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',state.lab===6?'true':'false');\n  button.innerHTML='<span>07</span>Vendor scoring';\n  button.onclick=()=>{state.lab=6;$$('[data-lab]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===button?'true':'false'));remember();procurement();};\n  tabs.appendChild(button);\n}\n\nfunction procurementScores(){\n  const minPrice=Math.min(...procurementVendors.map(v=>v.price));\n  const minLead=Math.min(...procurementVendors.map(v=>v.lead));\n  const maxWarranty=Math.max(...procurementVendors.map(v=>v.warranty));\n  const total=Object.values(procurementWeights).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)||1;\n  return procurementVendors.map(v=>{\n    const factors={price:minPrice/v.price*100,lead:minLead/v.lead*100,warranty:v.warranty/maxWarranty*100,compliance:v.compliance};\n    const score=Object.keys(factors).reduce((sum,key)=>sum+factors[key]*procurementWeights[key]/total,0);\n    return {...v,factors,score};\n  }).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score);\n}\n\nfunction procurement(){\n  const target=$('#workspace');if(!target)return;\n  const scores=procurementScores(),weightTotal=Object.values(procurementWeights).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),best=scores[0];\n  target.innerHTML=workspaceHeading('07','Compare the whole offer, not only the lowest number.','<button class=\"dark-button\" id=\"vendor-export\">Download .xlsx ↓</button>')+`\n    <div class=\"vendor-layout\">\n      <div class=\"vendor-weights\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DECISION WEIGHTS / TOTAL ${weightTotal}%</span>${Object.entries(procurementWeights).map(([ke